  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 91036662a85844eb162bdfbe2ea8ce9c, type: 3}
  m_Name: ItalianRules
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  displayName: Italian
  description: 8x8 draughts - short-range kings only, men can't capture backward or capture Kings.
  longDescription: "<b>Board Size & Unique Orientation</b>\nPlayed on a standard 8x8 grid using only the 32 dark squares. The board is rotated 90 degrees compared to American checkers: the bottom-right corner square (the cantone) must be a dark square for both players. Each player starts with 12 pieces on the dark squares of the three rows closest to them.\n\n<b>Basic Movement</b>\nForward Only: regular pieces (men) can only move one square diagonally forward into an empty dark square - they cannot move backward.\n\n<b>The Short-Range King</b>\nPromotion: when a piece reaches the opponent's back row, it becomes a King - if it lands there mid-jump sequence, its turn ends immediately. No Flying: unlike International or Russian checkers, Italian Kings do not fly - they only move one square diagonally, forward or backward. Immunity: regular pieces cannot capture Kings - a King can only be jumped and captured by an opposing King.\n\n<b>Strict Capture Hierarchy</b>\nCapturing is entirely mandatory, following a strict priority: 1) Maximum Quantity - choose the path that captures the largest amount of pieces. 2) King Dominance - if two paths capture an equal number, you must use a King to make the capture instead of a regular piece. 3) Target Kings - if the paths still tie, choose the path that captures the most Kings. 4) First Blood - if a tie still exists, choose the sequence that captures a King first.\n\n<b>Winning the Game</b>\nElimination or Blockade."
  rows: 8
  columns: 8
  pieceRowsPerSide: 3
  movementScheme: 0
  piecesOnAllSquares: 0
  leaveBackRowEmpty: 0
  flyingKings: 0
  menCaptureBackward: 0
  menCannotCaptureKings: 1
  mustCaptureMaximum: 1
  preferKingMover: 1
  preferKingCaptures: 1
  preferEarlierKingCapture: 1
  midChainPromotionRule: 1
  deferCaptureRemoval: 0
  forbidImmediateReversal: 0
  noProgressMoveLimit: 40
  singleManLosesToKing: 0
